Inclusion Criteria:

1. American Society of Anaesthesiologists (ASA) physical status 1-2
2. Female patients having laryngeal mask airway (LMA) for airway management for surgery in KKH;
3. BMI \< 40 kg/m2.

Exclusion Criteria:

